  "title": "Trump Attack on Higher Ed ‘More Serious Than McCarthy Era’",
  "content": "<span>Trump Attack on Higher Ed ‘More Serious Than McCarthy Era’</span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-featured-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img alt=\"Cover of Academic Freedom in the Era of Trump and headshots of the author Lee C. Bollinger and Geoffrey R. Stone\" height=\"666\" src=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/sites/default/files/2026-08/Book_Academic_Freedom_in_the_Era_of_Trump_Bollinger_and_Stone.jpg\" width=\"1000\" />\n\n</div>\n      \n<span><span>Emma Whitford</span></span>\n\n<span><time datetime=\"2026-08-26T03:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, August 26, 2026 - 03:00 AM\">Wed, 08/26/2026 - 03:00 AM</time>\n</span>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A new book edited by former Columbia University President Lee Bollinger and University of Chicago legal scholar Geoffrey Stone discusses how university autonomy is threatened by the Trump administration and what it might take to save it.</span></p>\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-authors field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Byline(s)</div>\n          <div class=\"field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/author/emma-whitford\" hreflang=\"en\">Emma Whitford</a></div>\n              </div>\n      </div>",
